{"id":200,"date":"2026-07-05T06:37:00","date_gmt":"2026-07-05T04:37:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/jdworld-os.netbird.cloud\/?p=200"},"modified":"2026-10-27T03:50:43","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T02:50:43","slug":"tui-jdwos-netbird-jdworld-os-netbird-suite","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/jdwos-packages\/mr_jack\/200\/","title":{"rendered":"[TUI] JDWOS-NETBIRD (JDWorld OS NetBird Suite)"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"862\" height=\"402\" src=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-netbird.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-312\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-netbird.png 862w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-netbird-300x140.png 300w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-netbird-768x358.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 862px) 100vw, 862px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>JDWorld OS Netbird Suite<\/strong> \u00e8 una <strong>TUI<\/strong> che si occupa di gestire l&#8217;agente netbird sul proprio sistema. <strong>NetBird<\/strong> \u00e8 una piattaforma <strong>open-source<\/strong> di <strong>Zero Trust Networking<\/strong> e gestione <strong>VPN<\/strong> basata sul protocollo <strong>WireGuard<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udce6 Scheda Tecnica del Pacchetto<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Name<\/strong>:  J\u00d0W\u00d8\u00aeL\u00d0 \u00d8S: Netbird Suite (<strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-luminous-vivid-amber-color\">jdwos-netbird.jdw<\/mark><\/strong>)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Architecture<\/strong>: Nativa Indipendente (x86_64)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Distro<\/strong>: Arch Linux<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>License(s)<\/strong>: Simplified BSD License<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Maintainers<\/strong>: JDWorld<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Package Size<\/strong>: 20 KB<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Update Date<\/strong>: 22-08-2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83e\uddf0 Dipendenze Richieste<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Il sistema provveder\u00e0 a scaricare automaticamente dai repository ufficiali puri di JDWorld OS:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><code>jdwos-corelib<\/code><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Istruzioni di Installazione rapida<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Grazie al nuovo <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/JDWorld\/jdwos-pm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">JDWorld OS Package Manager Universale<\/a><\/strong>, puoi installare questo pacchetto direttamente dal cloud senza scaricare nulla a mano. Apri il terminale e digita:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code class=\"\">sudo jdw-install jdwos-netbird<\/code><\/pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Se hai la necessit\u00e0 di rimuovere il software mantenendo puliti i registri di sistema:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code class=\"\">sudo jdw-remove jdwos-netbird<\/code><\/pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Nel caso preferite scaricare il pacchetto .jdw, per installarlo apri il terminale e digita:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code class=\"\">sudo jdw-install jdwos-netbird.jdw<\/code><\/pre>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udcbe Download Diretto del Binario<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/JDWorld\/jdwos-repo\/releases\/download\/latest\/jdwos-netbird.jdw\">Scarica il pacchetto binario jdwos-netbird.jdw<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Sviluppato come parte del sistema operativo personalizzato J\u00d0W\u00d8\u00aeL\u00d0 \u00d8S<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>JDWorld OS Netbird Suite \u00e8 una TUI che si occupa di gestire l&#8217;agente netbird sul proprio sistema. NetBird \u00e8 una piattaforma open-source di Zero Trust Networking e gestione VPN basata sul protocollo WireGuard. \ud83d\udce6 Scheda Tecnica del Pacchetto \ud83e\uddf0 Dipendenze Richieste Il sistema provveder\u00e0 a scaricare automaticamente dai repository ufficiali puri di JDWorld OS: \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"jdw_pacchetto_colore":"","jdw_pacchetto_versione":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[4],"tags":[7,23,29,43,50,55,63,65],"class_list":["post-200","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-jdwos-packages","tag-arch-linux","tag-jdworld-os","tag-jdwos-netbird","tag-netbird-p2p-vpn","tag-private-network","tag-rete-mesh","tag-tui","tag-vpn"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/200","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=200"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/200\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":429,"href":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-